  "debugData": {
    "name": "Ground decals",
    "description": "p309 D1: the toolkit's ground decals in the DECAL packing (albedoAlpha: sRGB albedo, A opacity; normalRough: normal XY, roughness, A the puddle mask), a 4 \u00d7 4 grid of 512 cells with 16 px of padding (480\u00b2 of content; levels 0-4), but tireTracks, a 1024 \u00d7 256 strip at its source's 4:1 (992 \u00d7 224 of content), the grid cell under it and the last one free. tireTracks (ambientCG TireTracks001) and asphaltDamage (AsphaltDamage001) from their pack recipes (decalTireTracks01/, decalAsphaltDamage01/); the other cells are procedural (p309 D5): a generator's bake exported as source/<cellId>_albedoAlpha.png and _normalRough.png (480\u00b2, the content size; the terrain gallery tab's procedural decals), the cell's data its recipe (generator, seed, params; params left out are the generator's defaults). A cell's data: physicalSize in m, tileAlong, opacitySource, and a procedural cell's generator, seed and params."
  }
